{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blinkhead</i> is a dark surreal psychological puzzle game where players must navigate through strange and dreamlike environments. Trapped inside shifting worlds, you must rely on logic, careful observation, and problem-solving skills to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle you overcome leads to a new surreal situation, unlocking further challenges that stand between you and freedom. The journey continues until you finally discover the truth\u2014and achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Environments</strong> \u2013 Explore mysterious, dreamlike spaces filled with unusual structures and hidden meanings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic-Based Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Solve challenging puzzles that require reasoning, observation, and creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Challenges</strong> \u2013 Each puzzle unlocks a new situation with increasingly complex obstacles to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Experience</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a dark and surreal atmosphere designed to keep you questioning reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Path to Victory</strong> \u2013 Continue unlocking new stages until you finally escape and achieve success.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953570/extras/e7f1dc4cefe5b4cf47dab60ba412be54.poster.avif?t=1762569304\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953570/extras/e7f1dc4cefe5b4cf47dab60ba412be54.webm?t=1762569304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953570/extras/e7f1dc4cefe5b4cf47dab60ba412be54.mp4?t=1762569304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Regret from never trying cuts deeper than failure itself. With that belief, you struggle to escape the dark path that lies before you. Every hallucination you face is a knot waiting to be untangled, every puzzle a reflection of the mind\u2019s hidden scars. Each door you unlock is not just an escape, but a step closer to hope&quot; \u2014 the journey of <strong>Blinkhead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953570?t=1762569304","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953570?t=1762569304","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953570/9b64b60d5cd1eb6eff0a1d0767404d76c399dfcc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762569304","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953570/9b64b60d5cd1eb6eff0a1d0767404d76c399dfcc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762569304","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4000070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blinkhead</i> is a dark surreal psychological puzzle game where players must navigate through strange and dreamlike environments. Trapped inside shifting worlds, you must rely on logic, careful observation, and problem-solving skills to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle you overcome leads to a new surreal situation, unlocking further challenges that stand between you and freedom. The journey continues until you finally discover the truth\u2014and achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s